{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33937","headline":"病中美景颇阻追游因寄鲁望 · 皮日休","name":"病中美景颇阻追游因寄鲁望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瘿牀闲卧昼迢迢，唯把真如慰寂寥。\n南国不须收薏苡，百年终竟是芭蕉。\n药前美禄应难断，枕上芳辰岂易销。\n看取病来多少日，早梅零落玉华焦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}